  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Roh-zee.jpg\" title=\"Roh-Zee\"><img alt=\"Roh-Zee\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"281\" src=\"/images/Roh-zee.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Roh-zee.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Roh-Zee</div></div></div>\n<p>Roh-Zee is the sworn enemy of The <a href=\"/wiki/Frump\" title=\"Frump\">Frump</a>. She is a giant <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Mutant Hulk</a> Hero and is found someplace on Level 4 of <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>.  She is a quest object.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
